  data: {
    LLM: "Identify your 'Void' suit. If you have only 2 cards in a suit, you are likely to be forced to win or lose tricks based on when that suit is led. If you have the Ace and 10 of a suit, aim for 3-4 tricks. If you have only 2s and Jacks, aim for 0.\n\nThe Joker Lead: Lead the Joker early if you are aiming for 3-4 tricks. This 'uses up' a trick you were guaranteed to win anyway, but it gives you the lead for the next trick where you can play your next lowest card to stay under the 5-trick limit.\n\nSocial Sabotage: If you see someone has 2 tricks and is trying to lose the rest, lead a suit they must follow with a high card to force them to take a 3rd trick (which they might want) or a 5th trick (which ruins them).",
    Player: "Identify your 'Void' suit. If you have only 2 cards in a suit, you are likely to be forced to win or lose tricks based on when that suit is led. If you have the Ace and 10 of a suit, aim for 3-4 tricks. If you have only 2s and Jacks, aim for 0.\n\nThe Joker Lead: Lead the Joker early if you are aiming for 3-4 tricks. This 'uses up' a trick you were guaranteed to win anyway, but it gives you the lead for the next trick where you can play your next lowest card to stay under the 5-trick limit.\n\nSocial Sabotage: If you see someone has 2 tricks and is trying to lose the rest, lead a suit they must follow with a high card to force them to take a 3rd trick (which they might want) or a 5th trick (which ruins them).",
